{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\nTVB戀愛真人騷《女神配對計劃 2》最新一集有震撼畫面！節目組今日（28日）搶先發布七位女神的水着照，當中陳若思（Amber）與陳星妤（Yvette）憑青春本錢極度搶鏡，而女神們的親密互動更成焦點，究竟現場發生甚麼事？\n</p>\n<h2>七大女神水着造型曝光 身材大比併各有千秋</h2>\n<p>在官方今日發布的水着照中，七位女神何沛珈（Roxanne）、陳若思（Amber）、郭珮文（Juliana）、梁超怡（Chiuyi）、陳星妤（Yvette）、阮嘉敏（Mandy）及俞可程（Kanis）在主題公園大玩水上遊戲，齊齊換上泳裝示人。當中以陳星妤及陳若思最為吸睛，盡騷青春本錢；梁超怡與阮嘉敏則大方展露纖腰，主打健美路線。相比之下，俞可程、何沛珈及郭珮文的造型就相對密實，七位女神風格各異，令觀眾期待值爆燈！</p>\n<h2>何沛珈俞可程公然抱腰 陳若思郭珮文全程拖實</h2>\n<p>除了泳裝造型，女神之間的親密互動亦成為照片的另一大亮點。在曝光的合照中，何沛珈（Roxanne）與俞可程（Kanis）猶如孖公仔，不但經常一起合照，更做出抱腰及翹手等親密舉動。另一邊廂，在節目開拍初期已十分投契的陳若思（Amber）與郭珮文（Juliana），拍攝時更是「攬到實一實」，全程拖實對方的手，關係好到儼如糖黐豆，完全不怕被誤會。</p>\n<h2>12勇者爭奪女神芳心 水上遊戲盡現真性情</h2>\n<p>TVB節目《女神配對計劃 2》由「金牌媒人」林盛斌（Bob）主持，節目安排12位求愛勇者與七位女神進行配對。在本周日（11月1日）晚播出的第九集，一眾參加者將移師主題公園進行水上遊戲，12位男士包括吳兆麟（Alan）、吳旭東（東東）等人，將與女神們有更多互動機會。節目組預告，透過刺激的水上遊戲，將能進一步展現各人最真實的性情，相信屆時配對形勢會更加緊張刺激。</p>\n<h2>網民洗版式留言激讚：「大飽眼福！」</h2>\n<p>照片曝光後，立即引起網民熱烈討論，不少人對女神們的水着造型大感驚喜，留言區被洗版式讚好。有網民興奮表示：「終於等到水着福利！大飽眼福！」、「Amber同Yvette真係屈機，青春無敵！」、「Chiuyi條腰好屈機，睇得出平時有做Gym！」亦有網民錯重點，將焦點放在女神們的友情上：「估唔到女仔真人騷都可以咁Friend，Roxanne同Kanis好Sweet！」、「Amber同Juliana係咪新CP？好可愛！」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/01_5480174656ae17a77065f4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/01_5480174656ae17a77065f4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/02_14206251706ae17a7996180.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/02_14206251706ae17a7996180.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/03_5066716016ae17a7f609f1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/03_5066716016ae17a7f609f1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/10_3031118376ae17a8562fbd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/10_3031118376ae17a8562fbd.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/11_9081694446ae17a91e2b86.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/11_9081694446ae17a91e2b86.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/12_14543399056ae17a9517839.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/12_14543399056ae17a9517839.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/13_14379689296ae17a98820f8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/13_14379689296ae17a98820f8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/18_10488294356ae17a9f69ce8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/18_10488294356ae17a9f69ce8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/19_19870656636ae17aa54b142.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/19_19870656636ae17aa54b142.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20_11937638046ae17aabe91d1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20_11937638046ae17aabe91d1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/22_5418027356ae17ab0c7f08.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/22_5418027356ae17ab0c7f08.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T08:21:47.736765+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1294,"images":11,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T08:00:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T08:18:41.736545+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T08:18:41.736545+00:00","content_hash":"ff8f60e12da0eb30b814cf10edac0408be87c7fdb14f1dcc53b816b731566566","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}